.TH SPACELIFT-HELPER 1
.SH NAME
spacelift-helper \\- normalize allowlisted Spacelift hook context
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B spacelift-helper
spacelift-helper [--format json]
.SH DESCRIPTION
Reads hook context and produces an allowlisted JSON representation. It does not replace native Spacelift policy enforcement.
.SH OPTIONS
Use \fBspacelift-helper --help\fR for the complete, version-specific flag list.
.SH EXIT STATUS
Uses the shared CLI status convention: 0 success, 1 a completed negative finding or policy failure, 2 invalid usage, 3 a partial result, and 4 a runtime failure. Not every status applies to every command.
